  "message": "feat(source): check dependent-index recursion and repeated function eta\n\nClose dependent index telescopes in family order for source matches and\nrecursive definitions. Recognize only domain-checked exact eta expansions\nof fixed recursive arguments, retaining all source typing obligations.\n\nExtend independent KR-312 conversion to repeated exact eta layers using\nmetered virtual shifts which reject captures of every removed binder.\nNo general unfolding, equality axiom or admission authority is added.\n\nAdd 8 dependent source tests, 2 fixed-argument tests, 4 independent eta\nregressions and an installed CLI regression. Local five-package verification\nreports 1492 top-level tests passing, zero failed or ignored; Clippy,\nworkspace compilation and format checks pass. Remote gates repeat before\npublication. Example checks 9 commands and 4 theorems. Related: fln-qb5.",
